<title>MACEDONIA: NATIONAL BANK OF MACEDONIA FIX FOR TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK OF MACEDONIA FIX FOR TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Macedonia (NBM) fix for</p>
<p>Tuesday:</p>
<p>    DEM 100 - 2,664.7580	USD   1 -  45.1676</p>
<p>    CHF 100 - 3,159.3371	ATS 100 - 378.6088</p>
<p>The NBM calculates the denar's rate against the German mark on the basis of</p>
<p>the information submitted by banks during the morning. Denar rates against</p>
<p>other currencies are worked out from the Frankfurt fixing rates, issued around</p>
<p>1500 local time.</p>
<p>Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
</text>
